  m_Name: Parametro_Sustentabilidade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Sustentabilidade
  _titleEn: Sustainability
  _category: 3
  _unlockTrigger: 1
  _summary: "A Sustentabilidade mede a sa\xFAde ambiental da cidade: \xE1reas verdes,
    qualidade do ar e da \xE1gua, res\xEDduos e emiss\xF5es. No jogo ela aparece
    em metros quadrados de \xE1rea verde por habitante."
  _summaryEn: 'Sustainability measures the city''s environmental health: green areas,
    air and water quality, waste and emissions. In the game it is shown as square
    meters of green area per person.'
  _realWorld: "A Organiza\xE7\xE3o Mundial da Sa\xFAde reuniu em 2016 as evid\xEAncias
    de que \xE1reas verdes urbanas reduzem calor, polui\xE7\xE3o e estresse."
  _realWorldEn: In 2016 the World Health Organization gathered the evidence that
    urban green spaces reduce heat, pollution and stress.
  _tradeOffs: "No curto prazo, proteger o ambiente custa caro e restringe atividades
    econ\xF4micas; o retorno costuma vir em prazos mais longos que um mandato."
  _tradeOffsEn: In the short term, protecting the environment is costly and restricts
    economic activity; the payoff usually comes over periods longer than a term in
    office.
  _sources:
  - Label: OMS, Urban green spaces and health (2016)
    Url: https://www.who.int/europe/publications/i/item/WHO-EURO-2016-3352-43111-60341
